                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "To me, it doesn\u2019t matter if you are a Democrat, Republican, or an independent \u2013 I want you to have health care you can afford. My colleagues need to join me. The people who voted them in are crying out for help. https://t.co/HXtaIYRCJ1",
